---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Policy | The Precon Market"
  description="How thepreconmarket.ca collects, uses, and protects your personal information."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[720px] px-4 pt-8 sm:px-6 sm:pt-12">
    <p class="section-label">— Privacy Policy</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold">Privacy policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 font-mono text-xs text-ink/50">Last updated: August 5, 2026</p>

    <div class="mt-6 space-y-6 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink/80">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink">What we collect</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          The rebate checker runs entirely in your browser. Your answers (purchase details, dates, prices) are not
          stored on a server by this website. If you choose to submit the contact form or book a call, we collect your
          name, email address, phone number, and your checker answers so we can prepare your breakdown and follow up.
        </p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink">How we use it</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Contact information and checker answers are used to send you your rebate summary, respond to your inquiry,
          and — if you consent — follow up about your purchase. Information is processed through our customer
          relationship management platform (GoHighLevel) and is not sold to third parties.
        </p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink">Analytics and advertising</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          This site may use Google Analytics and the Meta Pixel to measure traffic and advertising performance. These
          tools use cookies and may collect device and usage information. You can opt out of ad personalization
          through Google and Meta's own settings.
        </p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink">Your choices</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          You can use the checker without providing any contact information. To access, correct, or delete personal
          information you've submitted, contact Jordan Buttarazzi at
          <a href="tel:+16473711367" class="text-accent underline underline-offset-2">(647) 371-1367</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink">Who we are</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          This website is operated by Jordan Buttarazzi, Broker, Valery Real Estate Inc., Brokerage, RECO #5009855.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
